WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 11.8 · Fundraising, Revenue & Sustainable Business Models
Individual giving: one-time and recurring

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Design a journey that turns a first gift into a second, then a regular one.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Link suggested amounts to something concrete.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Thank within 48 hours and report the difference made.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Invite a monthly gift after the second gift.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Imara Girls in Science (Registered nonprofit · delivering, Kenya)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Imara: monthly gifts of US$5, US$10 or US$30; thanks within 48 hours; termly update; goal of 30 monthly donors by April.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You write your giving offer, supporter journey and measures.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
